{"ID":"20240220132605-ei4532f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132605-ei4532f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132605-ei4532f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171226-oat1rxe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171226-tbup9ff\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171226-tbup9ff\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:43,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:43\u0026#125;","title":"【黄连阿胶汤】（黄连阿胶鸡子黄汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171226-oat1rxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-oat1rxe","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百一十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-ifz140o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-ifz140o","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：【少阴病】，得之二三日以上，心中烦，不得卧者，【黄连阿胶汤】主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-e2qtvwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-e2qtvwo","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【黄连阿胶汤】是少阴症虚烦不得眠的主力处方，我常常用到心脏功能不好，肾脏功能不好。心肾中间是少阴，寒湿很盛的时候，梗在中间，造成心火没有办法下达。心肾没有办法相交，水火不相交。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-d4vlsfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-d4vlsfs","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连阿胶汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-lbc8kob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-lbc8kob","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连四两。黄芩一两。芍药二两。鸡子黄二枚。阿胶三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-ymgkm7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-ymgkm7x","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水五升，先煮三物，取二升，去渣，纳胶烊尽，小冷，纳鸡子黄，搅令相得，温服七合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-smdh9wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-smdh9wf","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这五味药"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蛋黄和阿胶先不煮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，黄芩黄连芍药五碗水煮成两碗，把渣去掉关火再放阿胶，用滚的力量把阿胶融化掉，阿胶不要煮，煮过之后阿胶就没有力量了。等温的时候，放鸡蛋黄下去，蛋白不要。热的时候成蛋花汤没有用，一定温的时候，生鸡蛋黄丢下去，和一和。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-9iqllp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-9iqllp1","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为寒湿很盛的时候，为什么会失眠？因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心血不够，心生血，脾统血，一旦影响到心脏脾脏的时候，就会贫血，黄连阿胶汤是治疗心血不足的时候使用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。苦味药入心，黄连苦味入心，对心是滋补的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心藏神"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肝藏魂，肺藏魄。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心中永远有一滴血停在里面，神就藏在那一滴血里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，新的血取代旧的血，心脏里面永远有一滴血在中间。少阴症很重的时候，血会伤到，这滴血会没有，当这滴血失去之后，心藏神，神就没有办法藏在心里面了，神就往外游，会失眠。黄连阿胶汤的阿胶能够补血，阿胶补血怎么那么凑巧补到心脏？这是因为加了鸡蛋黄，中药是取药性，我们要让阿胶悬浮在正中间，正好就像心脏那一滴血一样，找遍食物所有东西，只有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"鸡蛋黄永远是浮在中间"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以要用鸡蛋黄的性，把它导到里面去。这才是真正黄连阿胶汤的意思。生蛋黄下去，阿胶下去，苦味的药入心，苦味药把阿胶带到心脏中心，停到那就要靠蛋黄，蛋黄让这些药到此为止，专补心脏。所以这个药吃下去，就补那一滴血。不用鸡蛋黄不行。不加蛋黄药吃下去不能睡，蛋黄一下去就能睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171226-tbup9ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171226-tbup9ff","updated":"20240312171226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上碰到脉沉细，手脚冰冷，口渴，大便一天三四次，溏泻，失眠。就是黄连阿胶汤。一剂下去就中。"}]}]}